# Cloudflare Pages custom headers (the _redirects mechanism's sibling).
#
# HSTS: the browser remembers to NEVER speak plain HTTP to this host again, closing the
# first-visit downgrade window the https redirect alone leaves open (found 2026-08-01: the
# app's own zone served no HSTS while Supabase's did). One year, subdomains included so
# api.doubledone.app is covered the moment a browser has seen the apex. No `preload`
# on purpose: preload is effectively irreversible and belongs to a deliberate later choice.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
